import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 746 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 746 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems","no":746,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Symbiotic Network","Fifty Systems","Myriad-Rank Co-Build","Alaya Network"],"related":["10-300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview","21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle","25-Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0746_模块4-超多元级功法-共生网络类五十套详解.md","filePath":"en/0746_模块4-超多元级功法-共生网络类五十套详解.md"}'),r={name:"en/0746_模块4-超多元级功法-共生网络类五十套详解.md"};function a(s,e,l,c,u,d){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-746-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-details-of-the-fifty-symbiotic-network-systems" tabindex="-1">Entry 746 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-746-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-details-of-the-fifty-symbiotic-network-systems" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 746 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Details of the Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 21, 25</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-cultivation-is-not-one-person-s-affair-but-the-whole-network-s" tabindex="-1">Introduction: cultivation is not one person&#39;s affair, but the whole network&#39;s <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-cultivation-is-not-one-person-s-affair-but-the-whole-network-s" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: cultivation is not one person&#39;s affair, but the whole network&#39;s&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the 300-set Origin Cultivation System, the fifty Symbiotic-Network systems are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core marker distinguishing it from all old web-novel systems. Old web-novel cultivation is essentially &quot;one person&#39;s leveling game&quot; — you beat monsters, you level, you grow strong. Symbiotic-Network systems fundamentally negate this premise: <strong>cultivation is the network&#39;s affair, not the individual&#39;s.</strong> You grow stronger; the network grows stronger by a fraction; the network grows stronger; you also grow stronger. Individual and network are a positive-sum cycle, not a zero-sum game.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are Symbiotic-Network systems&#39; skeleton: the anti-predation axiom requires energy flow in the network all be reciprocal, not predatory; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires network nodes be open equally to all beings; the collective ascension axiom requires the network&#39;s collective-uplift rate exceed the individual-uplift rate; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-network operations be reported; the law-first axiom requires network laws be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-fifty-symbiotic-network-systems-classification-framework" tabindex="-1">I. The Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems&#39; Classification Framework <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-fifty-symbiotic-network-systems-classification-framework" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Fifty Symbiotic-Network Systems&#39; Classification Framework&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fifty Symbiotic-Network systems, by network layer, are divided into five subgroups of ten each:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Subgroup</th><th>Number Range</th><th>Core Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Personal Node</td><td>201–210</td><td>Onboard the individual cultivator into the symbiotic network as an effective node</td></tr><tr><td>Squad Collaboration</td><td>211–220</td><td>Small-team (3–10) cultivation coordination and energy sharing</td></tr><tr><td>City-State Interconnection</td><td>221–230</td><td>Cross-city-state, cross-race cultivation-resource interconnection and mutual aid</td></tr><tr><td>Plane-Level Net</td><td>231–240</td><td>The whole plane&#39;s cultivation-network construction and O&amp;M</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-Cosmos Net</td><td>241–250</td><td>Cross-multiverse symbiotic-network interconnection and coordination</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five subgroups, from &quot;one person joins the net&quot; to &quot;the whole cosmos networks,&quot; form a complete symbiotic-network-construction ladder.</p><h2 id="ii-personal-node-subgroup-201–210" tabindex="-1">II. Personal-Node Subgroup (201–210) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-personal-node-subgroup-201–210" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Personal-Node Subgroup (201–210)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems solve the problem of &quot;how the individual becomes an effective network node&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>201 · Energy Two-Way Anchoring</strong>: the individual cultivator&#39;s energy output and input interface with the network, both benefiting from and feeding back to the network;</li><li><strong>202 · Contribution Auto-Ledger</strong>: individual contributions to the network are automatically recorded, converting to civilizational weight;</li><li><strong>203 · Demand Auto-Report</strong>: individual cultivation-resource demands are automatically reported to the network, matched by the joint-production-contract mechanism;</li><li><strong>204 · Knowledge-Sharing Interface</strong>: new insights gained in personal cultivation are auto-uploaded to the network, for network-wide use;</li><li><strong>205–210</strong>: correspond to different node types&#39; onboarding schemes (humankind nodes, ferocious-beast nodes, plant-spirit nodes, etc.).</li></ul><p>This subgroup&#39;s core principle: joining the network is not one-way extraction, but a two-way cycle. You gain resources and knowledge from the network, and must also output contributions and insights to the network. Nodes that only take and never give are automatically down-weighted by the network.</p><h2 id="iii-squad-collaboration-subgroup-211–220" tabindex="-1">III. Squad-Collaboration Subgroup (211–220) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-squad-collaboration-subgroup-211–220" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Squad-Collaboration Subgroup (211–220)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems solve the problem of &quot;how small teams symbiose efficiently&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>211 · Energy Complementary Cycle</strong>: cultivators of different attributes in the team complement each other&#39;s energy, forming a closed loop;</li><li><strong>212 · Risk-Sharing Mechanism</strong>: the team&#39;s breakthrough-failure risk is borne by the whole team, not one person alone;</li><li><strong>213 · Experience Sync</strong>: team members&#39; cultivation experience syncs in real time; one person&#39;s insight benefits all;</li><li><strong>214 · Role Division</strong>: divide labor by the 300-set system&#39;s different directions — deduction, life, space each hold their post;</li><li><strong>215–220</strong>: correspond to different team sizes and task types&#39; collaboration schemes.</li></ul><p>This subgroup directly opposes old web novels&#39; &quot;lone-cultivator supremacy&quot; thinking. In Heng Yuan Zhou, squad collaboration&#39;s cultivation efficiency is always higher than lone cultivation — because of the network&#39;s compound-interest effect.</p><h2 id="iv-city-state-interconnection-and-plane-level-net-subgroups-221–240" tabindex="-1">IV. City-State Interconnection and Plane-Level Net Subgroups (221–240) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-city-state-interconnection-and-plane-level-net-subgroups-221–240" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. City-State Interconnection and Plane-Level Net Subgroups (221–240)&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>City-State Interconnection (221–230)</strong>: cross-city-state, cross-race cultivation-resource interconnection. For example, carbon-based humankind city-states&#39; spirit-medicine gardens interconnect with plant-spirit city-states&#39; seed vaults; mechanical-clan city-states&#39; energy factories interconnect with energy-condensing-clan city-states&#39; spirit veins. Resources are no longer monopolized by a single city-state, but flow network-wide.</p><p><strong>Plane-Level Net (231–240)</strong>: the whole plane&#39;s cultivation-network construction:</p><ul><li>231 · Plane Anchor Layout: deploy multiple Balanced-Anchor-level anchors within a plane, forming a distributed anchor network;</li><li>232 · Law-Monitoring Network-Wide: whole-plane real-time law monitoring, auto-alarm on anomalies;</li><li>233 · Resource Dispatch Center: whole-plane cultivation resources&#39; unified dispatch and allocation;</li><li>234–240: correspond to different plane types&#39; network-construction schemes (material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law-network layer each have adaptations).</li></ul><h2 id="v-cross-cosmos-net-subgroup-241–250" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Cosmos Net Subgroup (241–250) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-cosmos-net-subgroup-241–250" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Cosmos Net Subgroup (241–250)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These ten systems are Symbiotic-Network class&#39;s highest order:</p><ul><li><strong>241 · Cross-Cosmos Anchor Interconnection</strong> (detailed in entry 762): establish anchor connections between different multiverses;</li><li><strong>242 · Cross-Cosmos Knowledge Sync</strong>: cultivation knowledge from different cosmos is synced and shared through the anchor network;</li><li><strong>243 · Cross-Cosmos Resource Dispatch</strong>: dispatch energy, matter, manuals and other resources between cosmos;</li><li><strong>244 · Cross-Cosmos Consensus Mechanism</strong>: how Myriad-Rank representatives from different cosmos reach consensus on major issues;</li><li><strong>245–250</strong>: correspond to cross-cosmos network&#39;s security, defense, backup, and fault-tolerance directions.</li></ul><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: lone cultivation&#39;s efficiency is far below network collaboration; Symbiotic-Network systems converge scattered computable power into a joint force</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: energy flow in the network is two-way reciprocal; no node may only take and never give</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system is an oligarchic network — Gu Chensha, one node, monopolizes the whole net; Heng Yuan Zhou is a distributed network — ten million nodes connect equally</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: network nodes are open to all beings; the five lineages each have onboarding schemes, 99% coverage</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the fifty systems are all freely public; network-construction technology itself is the network&#39;s public product</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fifty Symbiotic-Network systems are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Myriad-Rank co-build&quot; idea concretely realized at the manual level. Cultivation is no longer one person&#39;s affair, but the whole network&#39;s — you grow stronger by a fraction, the whole net grows stronger by a fraction; the whole net grows stronger by a fraction, you grow stronger by a fraction. This is the manual expression of the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Joint-Production-Contract Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const y=t(r,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,y as default};
